# nebu-ctx — Context Engineering Layer

PREFER nebu-ctx MCP tools over native equivalents for token savings:

| PREFER | OVER | Why |
|--------|------|-----|
| `ctx_read(target="file"\|"files"\|"symbol"\|"outline"\|"archive", ...)` | `Read` / `cat` / `head` / `tail` | Cached, 10 compression modes |
| `ctx_search(mode="regex"\|"semantic", ...)` | `Grep` / `rg` | Compact results |
| `ctx_tree(path, depth)` | `ls` / `find` | Directory maps |
| `ctx(domain="memory"\|"context"\|"graph"\|"analytics"\|"agents"\|"inspect", action="...")` | private `ctx_*` tools | Higher-level workflows |

Shell: use native Shell/Bash — nebu-ctx shell hook compresses output automatically.
Edit/Write/Delete/Glob: use native tools.
